        "date": "2026-11-25T01:42:23Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(mcp): edit_tool refuses a form mill value that settling replaces\n\nReview of #3946, finding 1. A patch that states a diameter, a flute\nlength or outline points that the form outline or its preset then\nreplaces is refused by the field's name. It is no longer dropped with a\nsuccess. One rule covers each patched key: the stated tool is compared\nwith the settled tool. A preset number edit still settles.\n\nThe Draw cutter view shows a form mill's diameter and flute length and\ntakes no typing there, as the Tool tab does.\n\nRefs #3369\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
